From 9fb45813ce03e0a0f22215ebfdeee538d70d9209 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Provant15 <me@provant.dev>
Date: Sat, 7 Mar 2026 17:56:23 +1000
Subject: [PATCH 1/5] feat: add game bridge system with RCON player management

Add a game-agnostic bridge interface for communicating with game servers,
with RCON implementation for Minecraft. Includes:

- Game bridge interface with RCON and console fallback implementations
- RCON auto-configuration (password generation, server.properties patching)
- Player list polling with diff-based join/leave event emission
- REST endpoints for player list, actions, commands, and bridge status
- WebSocket subscription for real-time player events with ref counting
- Input validation and sanitization against command injection
- Exponential backoff on RCON errors with cached state retention

